{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_bdrk_ra5kckekxigbpsxfn22634wcve43y3qh5qwkaoconbjun4fjagaa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The implementation is complete. Summary of what was implemented in `src/bostree.rs`:\n\n**Tree operations:**\n- `bostree_new` — creates an empty tree with the supplied comparison/free functions.\n- `bostree_node_count` — returns total node count via root's child counts + 1.\n- `bostree_insert` — BST insertion with AVL rebalancing (single + double rotations) and child-count maintenance.\n- `bostree_remove` — handles three cases (no children / one child / two children), with the tricky two-child case that picks an in-order neighbour from the deeper side, splices out the candidate, replaces `node`, and rebalances both intermediate path and the bubble-up path.\n- `bostree_lookup`, `bostree_select` — standard BST/order-statistic lookups.\n- `bostree_print` — debug-only DOT format printout.\n\n**Node helpers:**\n- `bostree_next_node` / `bostree_previous_node` — in-order successor/predecessor traversal using parent pointers.\n- `bostree_rank` — computes in-order rank by walking up the tree.\n- `bostree_node_weak_ref` / `bostree_node_weak_unref` — weak reference counting matching the C semantics, calling the free function only when the count hits zero.\n\n**Internal helpers** (private to the module): `imax_u32`, `parent_of`, `is_left_child`, `compute_depth`, `balance_factor`, `rotate_left`, `rotate_right`. They use `Rc<RefCell<...>>` plus `Weak` for parent links, all in safe Rust (no `unsafe`, no FFI).\n\nVerified the implementation by replicating the C `sanity.c` and `remove_bug.c` tests (26 sequential inserts + removes with full sanity checks at each step, and removing each node from a 25-node tree) — both pass."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":256,"cache_read_input_tokens":51718,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":256,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0b173065-876d-4eca-ac04-e2449a233587","uuid":"45f36140-e255-4559-8639-0f9e866a39c2"}
